17. Critical Non-Regression Requirement

The integration must NOT break:

* Existing AIDLC portal.
* Existing tools.
* Existing authentication.
* Existing authorization.
* Existing reverse proxy.
* Existing tool routing.
* Existing deployment process.
* Existing Azure App Service behavior.

Release Tracker must be isolated enough that:

Release Tracker failure
        ≠
AIDLC portal failure

and:

Release Tracker deployment issue
        ≠
Existing tool outage

unless the architecture inherently makes this impossible. If such a dependency exists, document it clearly.

